    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Foxrock Avenue is a stunningly-presented, semi-detached 4 bed with ground floor granny flat. Gardener's Dream with mature landscaping front and back.\r\n\r\n Extending to 149sqm, the house has been lovingly maintained and extended over the years to include; These impressive houses at the quiet end of Foxrock Avenue, offer the opportunity for spacious family living, in a highly convenient location, close to some of the best schools in South Dublin. Poised between Blackrock, Foxrock and Deansgrange, you have an abundance of amenities on your doorstep and quick access to the N11 or the DART into the rest of Dublin.\r\n\r\nThe property offers an attractive frontage, blooming with mature trees and shrubs, and providing off-street car parking. A welcoming entrance hall leads into a bright open plan house. The former garage has been converted and extended into a self-contained 'granny flat' including bedroom, shower room/WC, closet and complete kitchenette with own access to the rear garden. The property's back garden is similarly green, bursting with fabulous trees and planting. Three separate decking areas provide outdoor living in a variety of sun-trap corners. The rear is completely private, set well back from the road - your own perfect haven. \r\n\r\nUpstairs provides fours spacious bedrooms, main family bathroom and an attic with great potential for conversion (S.T.P.P.). From the rear windows, you have a stunning view across South Dublin with the Sea and Howth in the distance.\r\n\r\n4 Foxrock Avenue is presented in \"Walk-in Ready' condition - but with huge potential to enhance and extend to suit your family's requirements. \r\n\r\nFEATURES \r\n.\r\n- A large double aspect open plan, living room with beautiful views of front and rear gardens; open wood burning fireplace and solid timber floors.\r\n\r\n- Wide entrance hall, flooded with light, with walk-in guest closet. \r\n\r\n- Rear kitchen overlooking the garden, with direct access onto the raised deck and barbeque / entertaining area. \r\n\r\n- Ground floor granny flat with bedroom, own WC/ shower room, walk in closet, and a complete kitchenette. \r\n\r\n- Upstairs features 4 spacious bedrooms, including 2 large doubles with built-in storage; plus 2 smaller, double / single rooms. \r\n\r\n- The master bedroom incl. 2 built-in closets & plumbed for an en suite shower.\r\n\r\n- Attic insulated & providing ample storage; with conversion potential (S.T.P.P.) which could provide an impressive ensuite bedroom with clear sea views.\r\n\r\n- The house features beautiful, large double glazed windows with stunning views and bringing in ample light\r\n\r\n- Modern condensing gas boiler; electric underfloor heating in bathrooms floors.\r\n\r\n- BER D Rating with great potential to upgrade with available Energy Efficiency Grants.\r\n\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n4 Foxrock Avenue is located in an affluent South Dublin suburb, perfectly positioned between the vibrant villages of Foxrock, Blackrock, and Deansgrange. This highly sought-after Dublin 18 address combines a peaceful residential setting with exceptional urban convenience.\r\n\r\n- Foxrock Village: Minutes away, offering upscale boutiques, gourmet dining, and a charming village atmosphere.\r\n\r\n- Blackrock: Nearby coastal hub featuring two modern shopping centres, premier restaurants, and seaside walks.\r\n\r\n- Deansgrange: Easily accessible for daily essentials, supermarkets, local libraries, and excellent cafes.\r\n\r\n\r\nTransport - A one-minute walk to the N11 Quality Bus Corridor (QBC) for rapid, direct access to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nSchools - Surrounded by top-tier institutions including Hollypark National Schools, Lycée Français d'Irlande, and Loreto College Foxrock."
      },
